{"id": "affordable-housing-power-connection-delays", "title": "Two affordable housing projects drew $13.2 million after power delays", "seconds": 57.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "1821f0c281ee273a", "words": 149, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "At 555 Larkin, workers found equipment buried in the approved trench.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.63, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "committee", "text": "unmarked PG&E utilities", "mark": "unmarked"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.48, 1.19, 1.61, 2.05, 2.31, 2.83, 3.25, 3.34, 3.43, 3.88]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The housing office says the utility required another design review.", "t0": 4.75, "t1": 8.42, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "committee", "text": "design stage", "mark": "design"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.56, 0.89, 1.18, 1.31, 1.86, 2.32, 2.67, 3.15]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The building received permanent power nine months late.", "t0": 8.54, "t1": 11.46, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "9 months", "label": "Delay in permanent power"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 0.95, 1.43, 1.86, 2.15, 2.51]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Board and the signed Larkin loan give different increases.", "t0": 11.58, "t1": 15.03, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "turkdeed", "text": "Additional Funding", "mark": "Funding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.53, 0.65, 0.74, 1.14, 1.57, 1.94, 2.18, 2.59]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The signed increase was $40,000 lower.", "t0": 15.15, "t1": 17.96, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$40,000", "label": "Difference from the resolution"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 1.01, 1.2, 1.54, 1.94, 2.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "At Islais Place, the drawings assumed a connection about thirty feet away.", "t0": 18.18, "t1": 22.16, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "30 feet", "label": "Original tie-in assumption"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.6, 1.12, 1.26, 1.72, 2.1, 2.17, 2.66, 2.95, 3.3, 3.54]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The utility assigned a point about 1,800 feet away.", "t0": 22.28, "t1": 25.55, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1,800 feet", "label": "Assigned tie-in"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.66, 1.05, 1.13, 1.45, 1.76, 2.22, 2.58, 2.85]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The trenching estimate alone was $1.7 million.", "t0": 25.67, "t1": 29.54, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.7 million", "label": "Estimated trenching cost"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.7, 1.17, 1.59, 1.82, 2.07, 2.43, 2.81, 3.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City paid both housing partnerships through supplemental loans.", "t0": 29.66, "t1": 33.29, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vouchers", "text": "Loans Issued By City", "mark": "Loans"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.74, 1.06, 1.48, 2.15, 2.4, 3.04]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The vouchers add up to $13,203,618.", "t0": 33.41, "t1": 36.83, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$13,203,618", "label": "City loans paid to the housing partnerships"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.61, 0.83, 0.97, 1.08, 1.36, 1.92, 2.21, 2.45, 2.83]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Larkin finished leasing its apartments in May 2023.", "t0": 37.05, "t1": 40.5, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "turkdelivery", "text": "Lease-up completed May 2023", "mark": "May 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.86, 1.21, 1.35, 1.93, 2.07, 2.33, 2.68]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Islais Place received its occupancy certificate in February 2024.", "t0": 40.62, "t1": 45.32, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "missiondelivery", "text": "2/16/2024", "mark": "2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.86, 1.29, 1.49, 2.13, 2.79, 2.95, 3.46, 3.87]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Federal regulators later ruled against the utility’s treatment of certain costs.", "t0": 45.44, "t1": 49.78, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2025", "label": "Federal ruling on distribution costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 1.04, 1.38, 1.69, 2.07, 2.19, 2.79, 3.2, 3.31, 3.67]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The public record leaves repayment to either housing project unverified.", "t0": 49.9, "t1": 53.94, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sept", "text": "Wholesale Distribution Tariff", "mark": "Tariff"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.85, 1.17, 1.75, 1.87, 2.17, 2.59, 3.15]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 54.06, "t1": 56.67, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "A blocked trench", "b": "The City’s two loans", "c": "When residents could move in"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}